DATA = 'Spring period|T=2*pi*sqrt(m/ks)|T,m,ks|0++|Ideal mass-spring; no damping.|P:1,-2*pi*sqrt(m/ks);E:(1/4)*T^2*ks/pi^2;E:4*pi^2*m/T^2\nPendulum period|T=2*pi*sqrt(l/g)|T,l|0+|Small angle; point bob; g=9.8.|P:sqrt(g),-2*pi*sqrt(l);E:(1/4)*T^2*g/pi^2\nPhysical pendulum|T=2*pi*sqrt(I/(m*g*d))|T,I,m,d|0++s|Small angle; d pivot-to-COM positive.|P:sqrt(g),-2*pi*sqrt(I/(d*m));E:(1/4)*T^2*d*g*m/pi^2;E:4*pi^2*I/(T^2*d*g);E:4*pi^2*I/(T^2*g*m)\nTorsion period|T=2*pi*sqrt(I/kap)|T,I,kap|0++|Linear restoring torque=-kap*angle.|P:1,-2*pi*sqrt(I/kap);E:(1/4)*T^2*kap/pi^2;E:4*pi^2*I/T^2\nFrequency period|f=1/T|f,T|+0|Positive frequency and period.|P:T,-1;P:f,-1\nAngular frequency|w=2*pi*f|w,f|s+|w here is positive oscillation frequency.|P:1,-2*pi*f;P:-2*pi,w\nSpring frequency|w^2=ks/m|w,ks,m|s++|Choose positive angular frequency.|P:m,0,-ks;P:-1,m*w^2;P:w^2,-ks\nSHM acceleration|a=-w^2*x|a,w,x|sss|x from equilibrium; positive frequency.|P:1,w^2*x;P:x,0,a;P:w^2,a\nSHM energy|E=ks*amp^2/2|E,ks,amp|s+0|Total mass-spring energy; amp>=0.|P:2,-amp^2*ks;P:-amp^2,2*E;P:-ks,0,2*E\nSHM speed-position|v^2=w^2*(amp^2-x^2)|v,w,amp,x|ss0s|abs(x)<=amp; choose sign from motion.|P:1,0,-amp^2*w^2 + w^2*x^2;P:-amp^2 + x^2,0,v^2;P:-w^2,0,v^2 + w^2*x^2;P:w^2,0,-amp^2*w^2 + v^2\nSHM position|x=amp*cos(w*t+ph)|x,amp,w,t,ph|s0s0s|Undamped sinusoid; phase in radians.|P:1,-amp*cos(ph + t*w);P:-cos(ph + t*w),x;E:;E:;E:'
